    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8084c3a3fd8ca7b3aaaf2f03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "更有甚至将末脚进一步磨砺、以惊人爆发力制霸赛事的\n赛马娘们崭露头角——如今，她们正逐渐成为新的核心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28c202bd054f1eddfca2aa14dfa0c9a0ebc65f66e9da522f36887762e381b44f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
