    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0440b5ff5671a38cd70a77be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，群星不止一颗。有在特定路线上绽放绝顶光芒的星辰，\n也有将光芒照向海外的星辰……夜空中浮现着无数璀璨的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "170ee0a4ab1f2a581b14c4ba3c94269557329884ab9a1c89721a660f18cfae26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
