    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b603ac9906beee79aee7cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而那颗格外耀眼的星辰，究竟会掀起怎样的爆发——\n就连宇宙本身，也无从知晓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfcf242090ce397e17f92f59ac348f5dfdf6b37eaff7998006e3a8514aece8e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1141/storytimeline_041141001.json",
