    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7600c3c4c6a3ec51a4f5215c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为一名新人训练员，为了赛马娘所要学习的东西无穷无尽。\n为了获得成长，我前来参加URA主办的特别讲座。结果——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c5706cae6ac95b991e335f5deafc3e3a92e9564b3b84ed67ed40faf5cac8658",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1141/storytimeline_041141001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af58f5d13bbd4180eb89dba7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（话说那个孩子——是西沙里奥……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "60bccc123486bc71f4017ef71f8eb713dbaf5d0f83d1432d6dea21a8f987d752",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1141/storytimeline_041141001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
