    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a13583c177daf2cb519fc75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在日本成为橡树大赛赛马娘后，又达成了作为日本赛马娘\n史上首次赢得『美国橡树大赛』的伟业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3453ed80285816696385f22915044f089fd7d09ddfb96eb2cb4a38f90a8acab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
