    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13f956f06170a0b4309ce012",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仿佛被某种强大的力量所引导，我回答说要成为她的训练员。\n……是的，就这么一口答应下来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f2026c6d646cdcbe7407493e145e06ec54f6ffd267a4c2b293b8a96cc76ca8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1141/storytimeline_041141002.json",
      "json_path": [
