    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:579dc28942384e28b0db101e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的能力、目标与梦想……为了对她宝贵的竞技生涯负责，\n我需要了解的事情堆积如山。无论如何，我都想和她好好谈谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "389b9167d2d13447bccd6a2f15ae32d80c13de5c83080b36d9fc54c75eaa64ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
